A [[Secret Switch]] is a switch which opens a hidden path. These paths tend to be dead ends but do contain [[Hidden Treasure]]s and/or [[Dwarven Ghost]]s.

Secret Switches are revealed when the skill [[Light of Deldrimor]] is used nearby.

